$\n[{b}_{1}]_{S}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,[{b}_{2}]_{S}=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],\\,[{b}_{3}]_{S}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe change-of-coordinates matrix from $B$ to $S$ is a matrix whose respective columns are the coordinates of the vectors of $B$ relative to the basis $S.$ \n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n{P}_{B\\to S}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $a=7,$ $b=0,$ and $c=0.$" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351009 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351010 13194139535473 true] [17592186351009 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351011 13194139535473 true] [17592186351009 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351012 13194139535473 true] [17592186351009 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351013 13194139535473 true] [17592186351009 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351014 13194139535473 true] [17592186351009 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535473 true] [17592186351009 1041 "selection" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351009 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351010 13194139535473 true] [17592186351009 1110 #uuid "1549485a-6e21-5c6c-862f-712d2c5729f1" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351010 1034 "$a=7,$ $b=0,$ and $c=0$" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351010 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535473 true] [17592186351010 1111 #uuid "6cdee27f-9ce7-5f65-9310-00235c8fcbfd" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351011 1034 "$a=0,$ $b=7,$ and $c=0$" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351011 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535473 true] [17592186351011 1111 #uuid "f20bc0fc-dae5-5839-aa1f-0095d12ea376" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351012 1034 "$a=1,$ $b=-2,$ and $c=0$" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351012 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535473 true] [17592186351012 1111 #uuid "0a50abd6-68bc-5a72-ae10-d9c84f5e9dfa" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351013 1034 "$a=7,$ $b=0,$ and $c=-1$" 13194139535473 true] [17592186351013 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535473 true] [17592186351013 1111 #uuid "1eec352b-5f82-5d59-9239-a